-- Repoint externally-sourced past-paper PDFs at our private-bucket copies.
--
-- The archive previously stored direct PhysicsAndMathsTutor PDF URLs in
-- paper_url / mark_scheme_url, which the client opened publicly (no watermark,
-- no entitlement gate, no audit trail). Each URL below was downloaded and
-- uploaded to the private past-papers bucket; this migration swaps the URL for
-- the storage path so reads route through serve-material.
--
-- Generated from .freebuff/pp-ingest-map.json (331 question papers,
-- 332 mark schemes). Re-running is safe: each statement matches on
-- the exact external URL, which no longer exists after the first application.

